[Desktop Entry]
Name=Repositórios (VS Code)
Comment=Acha repositórios git e pastas recentes do VS Code e abre no editor
Type=Service
Icon=folder-git
X-KDE-ServiceTypes=Plasma/Runner
X-KDE-PluginInfo-Author=JacundaEntorpe
X-KDE-PluginInfo-Name=krocket-repos
X-KDE-PluginInfo-Version=1.1
X-KDE-PluginInfo-License=MIT
X-KDE-PluginInfo-EnabledByDefault=true
X-Plasma-API=DBus
X-Plasma-DBusRunner-Service=org.jacunda.krocket
X-Plasma-DBusRunner-Path=/repos
X-Plasma-Request-Actions-Once=true
X-Plasma-Runner-Syntaxes=vs :q:
X-Plasma-Runner-Syntax-Descriptions=Abre no VS Code o repositório cujo nome bate com :q: (também funciona sem o vs)
